                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "House Republicans just passed their slash-and-burn budget that will gut Medicaid and nutrition programs\u2014all to hand $4.5 trillion in tax breaks to billionaires. It even raises taxes on working families. \n\nI\u2019m a BIG, FAT \u2018HELL NO\u2019 on this betrayal and will keep fighting to stop this ridiculous attack on Americans.  \n\nWatch my remarks from today on the House floor:",
