                "text": "March is National Nutrition Month \u2014 a time to focus on making informed and healthy food choices. But fresh high quality food isn\u2019t always an option for those living paycheck to paycheck.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nFor families in California, SNAP can help you put healthy food on the table. Learn more and apply at https://t.co/pEvPaj8VXM.",
