                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Vista Social",
                "text": "The Dream Center is one of many critical nonprofits giving Angelenos a helping hand in their time of need, whether they\u2019re experiencing homelessness, facing food insecurity, or are in foster care.\n\nI\u2019m proud to support their efforts in Congress by fighting for expanded nutrition benefits and investments into affordable housing.",
